<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2">
  <Document>
    <name>Scamland · Golden Triangle · bản đồ gốc + OSINT</name>
    <description>Golden Triangle Special Economic Zone 金三角经济特区 in Bokeo province in Laos. Casino, hotels, entertainment and online fraud activities.&lt;br&gt;#gtsez #goldentriangle #onlinescam #cyberfraud #casino #GoldenKapokGroup #ZhaoWei #Laos&lt;br&gt;#金三角经济特区&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Bổ sung Scamland, 2026-10-11&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;87 mốc gốc giữ nguyên; 8 mốc OSINT riêng, tọa độ chỉ báo.&lt;br&gt;Các địa danh gốc không tự xác nhận hành vi phạm tội.&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/Base27-CVNSS/Scamland"&gt;Mã nguồn Scamland&lt;/a&gt; · &lt;a href="https://base27-cvnss.github.io/Scamland/"&gt;WebGIS&lt;/a&gt;</description>
