    <Folder>
      <name>Golden Triangle Special Economic Zone</name>
      <Placemark>
        <name>News about Golden Triangle Special Economic Zone 金三角经济特区</name>
        <description>Read:&lt;br&gt;Online Scam: How the Chinese Police raided the Golden Triangle Special Economic Zone in Laos &lt;br&gt;https://treasuresoflaos.blogspot.com/2024/03/how-chinese-police-raided-golden.html (February 2024)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;16 Indians rescued from scam operations in Laos (March 2024)&lt;br&gt;https://www.rfa.org/english/news/laos/indians-rescued-03282024180122.html&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Macao at Mekong: How Chinese money flows into the Golden Triangle&lt;br&gt;https://treasuresoflaos.blogspot.com/2013/02/macao-on-mekong-how-chinese-money-flows.html</description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1608-9C27B0</styleUrl>
        <Point>
          <coordinates>
            100.1113782,20.3413949,0
          </coordinates>
        </Point>
      </Placemark>
      <Placemark>
        <name>News about Bokeo International Airport 博胶国际机场</name>
        <description>Bokeo International Airport: For two millions of Passengers - but only one Flight daily until now. Read:&lt;br&gt;https://treasuresoflaos.blogspot.com/2024/01/what-happens-to-bokeo-international.html</description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1504-0288D1</styleUrl>
        <Point>
          <coordinates>
            100.157846,20.3192299,0
          </coordinates>
        </Point>
      </Placemark>
      <Placemark>
        <name>Kapok Star Hotel 木棉之星酒店</name>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1602-A52714-nodesc</styleUrl>
